# .trivyignore
# Security Scanner Exclusion File for Trivy Container Vulnerability Scanning
# Guidelines:
# - Each ignored CVE must include an explanation and justification.
# - Do not suppress CRITICAL vulnerabilities that affect the running application.
# - Trivy automatically detects this file in the repository root.

# Upstream Base Image / libc / Kernel CVEs without Available Fixes

# CVE-2023-45853: zlib buffer overflow in MiniZip (upstream Debian unpatched)
# Rationale: MiniZip is not invoked or reachable by our Python FastAPI runtime.
CVE-2023-45853

# CVE-2024-24790: Go stdlib net/netip IPv6 address formatting issue
# Rationale: External Go build dependency; runtime executes strictly on Python 3.11 distroless.
CVE-2024-24790
